        <activityName xml:lang="en">HDMI cable, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: HDMI cable, at plant
The dataset is made using a combination of other cable components in the UVEK databse; UUID: 279bbcd8-c0a1-3bf3-ba9a-a851eea7b7af
This dataset for HDMI cable is modelled as a mixture of cable, plugs, and connectors. The total length of the cable is 2 m. The copper wire is selected as conducting materials while PVC is selected as the jacket component. The composition of HDMI cable was compared with material datasheets commonly found in the market.
Location: Data for global average HDMI cables
Technology: Average HDMI cables.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_279bbcd8-c0a1-3bf3-ba9a-a851eea7b7af.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
